@section exampleDescription {
<section aria-label="页面描述">
    <p>演示让列布局外层高度按列内容计算。</p>
    <h3><i class="f-icon f-iconfont f-iconfont-layout" aria-hidden="true"></i>对照布局与尺寸变化</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>在<strong class="example-control-reference" data-example-control="Panel1" title="面板">面板</strong>中对照最高一列与外层底边。<br />结果：外层能包含最高列内容，其它列仍按各自列宽排列。</li>
    </ul>
    <h3><i class="f-icon f-iconfont f-iconfont-gear" aria-hidden="true"></i>关键属性</h3>
    <ul class="example-description-properties">
        <li><code>Layout</code>（<strong class="example-control-reference" data-example-control="Panel1" title="面板">面板</strong>）：初始为<code>Column</code>，父容器使用本页对应的布局方式，决定其直接子项的排列。</li>
        <li><code>ColumnWidth</code>（<strong class="example-control-reference" data-example-control="Panel24" title="第 2 个面板">第 2 个面板</strong>、<strong class="example-control-reference" data-example-control="Panel28" title="第 6 个面板">第 6 个面板</strong>、<strong class="example-control-reference" data-example-control="Panel32" title="第 10 个面板">第 10 个面板</strong>）：各组分别设为<code>33%</code>、<code>34%</code>，规定当前子项占用的列宽。</li>
        <li><code>Height</code>（<strong class="example-control-reference" data-example-control="Panel1" title="面板">面板</strong>）：显式高度限定可用区域；未设置固定高度的对照组按内容和父布局计算。</li>
    </ul>
</section>
}
